NNAAMMEE
     iissppffww — Firmware for Qlogic FibreChannel SCSI Host Adapters

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into the kernel, place the following line in your
     kernel configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee iissppffww

     Alternatively, to load the driver as a module at boot time, place the
     following line in loader.conf(5):

           ispfw_load="YES"

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     This trivial driver provides access to firmware sets for the Qlogic Fi‐
     breChannel SCSI Host Adapters.  It may either be statically linked into
     the kernel, or loaded as a module.  In either case, the isp(4) driver
     will notice that firmware is available to be downloaded onto Qlogic cards
     (to replace the usually out of date firmware on the cards).  This will
     kick the f/w into getting unstuck.

